    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Some call you a dilettante, but you insist on being called well-rounded.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Runes class feature</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Choose a single rune with a Least variant. You learn the chosen rune.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> You can gain Rune Study multiple times. Each time, select a new rune with a Least variant.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/runesmithing-feats#toc5\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
